---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="About Siryus Creative Media Ltd"
  description="Siryus Creative Media Ltd is a creative company built for independent artists and brands doing artist management, marketing and production from Kigali, Rwanda."
  canonical="https://www.siryushub.com/about"
>
  <div class="about-page">
    <section class="about-bleed about-hero about-hero--editorial about-reveal" aria-labelledby="about-hero-heading">
      <div class="about-hero__bg" aria-hidden="true">
        <img
          class="about-hero__bg-img"
          src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1507842217343-583bb7270b66?w=1920&q=80&auto=format&fit=crop"
          alt=""
          width="1920"
          height="1080"
          loading="eager"
          decoding="async"
        />
        <div class="about-hero__bg-scrim"></div>
      </div>
      <div class="about-hero__grain" aria-hidden="true"></div>
      <div class="about-hero__warm-glow" aria-hidden="true"></div>
      <div class="about-inner about-hero__shell">
        <div class="about-hero__grid">
          <div class="morph-hero-manuscript about-hero__manuscript">
            <div class="morph-hero-manuscript__well about-hero__well">
              <span class="about-hero__label">Our Story</span>
              <h1 id="about-hero-heading" class="about-hero__title">
                We Are Not an Agency. We Are Builders.
              </h1>
              <p class="about-hero__sub">
                Siryus Creative Media Ltd was built for the creatives who refuse to fit the mold.
              </p>
              <hr class="about-hero__rule" />
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="about-hero__visual">
            <div class="morph-skeuo-frame about-hero__frame">
              <img
                src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1519682337058-a94d519337bc?w=800&q=80&auto=format&fit=crop"
                alt="Open notebook, pen, and warm desk light suggesting focused creative work"
                width="800"
                height="1000"
                loading="eager"
                decoding="async"
              />
            </div>
            <div class="morph-hero-glass-orb about-hero__orb" aria-hidden="true"></div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="about-bleed about-story about-reveal" aria-labelledby="about-story-heading">
      <div class="about-inner about-story__grid">
        <div class="about-story__quote-wrap">
          <h2 id="about-story-heading" class="about-section-heading">How We Got Here</h2>
          <blockquote class="about-story__pull">
            Art without strategy is a hobby. Strategy without art is noise. We do both.
          </blockquote>
        </div>
        <div class="about-story__body">
          <p>
            Siryus started as a simple idea. What if there was one place where independent creatives could get real
            management, real marketing support, and a real community, without having to deal with the politics of a big
            agency or figure everything out alone?
          </p>
          <p>
            We are incorporated in Nigeria and operate out of Kigali, Rwanda. We work with artists and brands across
            Africa and beyond. Our work spans artist management under SIRYUS A.M, content and brand marketing for
            companies that want to grow, and creative production that actually moves people.
          </p>
          <p>
            We are a small team with a big appetite. We do not take on everyone. We work with people who are serious
            about what they are building and want a partner who is equally serious about helping them get there.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="about-bleed about-values about-reveal" aria-labelledby="about-values-heading">
      <div class="about-inner">
        <h2 id="about-values-heading" class="about-section-heading about-values__title">What We Stand For</h2>
        <div class="about-values__grid">
          <article class="morph-clay-card about-value-card">
            <div class="about-value-card__icon" aria-hidden="true">
              <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="28" height="28" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
                <path d="M9 18V5l12-2v13"></path>
                <circle cx="6" cy="18" r="3"></circle>
                <circle cx="18" cy="16" r="3"></circle>
              </svg>
            </div>
            <h3 class="about-value-card__heading">Artists First</h3>
            <p class="about-value-card__copy">
              Every decision we make starts with one question. Is this good for the artist? That applies to management,
              marketing, and everything in between.
            </p>
          </article>
          <article class="morph-clay-card about-value-card">
            <div class="about-value-card__icon" aria-hidden="true">
              <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="28" height="28" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
                <circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"></circle>
                <line x1="22" y1="12" x2="18" y2="12"></line>
                <line x1="6" y1="12" x2="2" y2="12"></line>
                <line x1="12" y1="6" x2="12" y2="2"></line>
                <line x1="12" y1="22" x2="12" y2="18"></line>
              </svg>
            </div>
            <h3 class="about-value-card__heading">Strategy Over Hype</h3>
            <p class="about-value-card__copy">
              Trends fade. A real strategy compounds. We build things that work past the first week and the first drop.
            </p>
          </article>
          <article class="morph-clay-card about-value-card">
            <div class="about-value-card__icon" aria-hidden="true">
              <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="28" height="28" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
                <circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"></circle>
                <line x1="2" y1="12" x2="22" y2="12"></line>
                <path d="M12 2a15.3 15.3 0 0 4 10 4 15.3 15.3 0 0 1-4 10 15.3 15.3 0 0 1-4-10 15.3 15.3 0 0 1 4-10z"></path>
              </svg>
            </div>
            <h3 class="about-value-card__heading">African and Global</h3>
            <p class="about-value-card__copy">
              We are rooted in Africa and built for the world. The two are not in conflict. They never were.
            </p>
          </article>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="about-bleed about-team about-reveal" aria-labelledby="about-team-heading">
      <div class="about-inner">
        <h2 id="about-team-heading" class="about-section-heading">The People Behind Siryus</h2>
        <div class="about-team__block">
          <article class="about-founder-card">
            <div class="founder-photo">
              <img
                class="founder-photo__img"
                src="/images/team/cheedii.jpg"
                alt="Chidiebere Ekwedike"
                width="400"
                height="400"
                loading="lazy"
              />
              <div class="founder-photo__placeholder" aria-hidden="true">CE</div>
            </div>
            <div class="about-founder-card__text">
              <p class="about-founder-card__name">Chidiebere Ekwedike</p>
              <p class="about-founder-card__title">Role: Founder, Siryus Creative Media Ltd</p>
              <p class="about-founder-card__resp">
                Responsibilities: Leads company vision and strategy, oversees SIRYUS A.M and Siryus Hub, and works
                hands-on with artists, talent, and partners so creative goals turn into real outcomes.
              </p>
              <p class="about-founder-card__bio">
                Copywriter, front-end developer, and talent manager. Chidiebere started Siryus to bridge the gap between
                creative talent and the business side of the industry. Based in Kigali. Rooted in Nigeria.
              </p>
            </div>
          </article>

          <ul class="about-team__grid" role="list">
            <li>
              <article class="about-team-card morph-clay-card">
                <div class="about-team-card__avatar" aria-hidden="true">MU</div>
                <h3 class="about-team-card__name">Maryann Ugwu</h3>
                <p class="about-team-card__role">Role: Vice President</p>
                <p class="about-team-card__resp">
                  Responsibilities: Supports executive leadership, aligns departments with company priorities, and helps
                  steer long-term growth, partnerships, and strategic initiatives.
                </p>
              </article>
            </li>
            <li>
              <article class="about-team-card morph-clay-card">
                <div class="about-team-card__avatar" aria-hidden="true">IF</div>
                <h3 class="about-team-card__name">Iwejuo Francis</h3>
                <p class="about-team-card__role">Role: COO</p>
                <p class="about-team-card__resp">
                  Responsibilities: Runs day-to-day operations, internal processes, and cross-team coordination so delivery
                  stays on schedule and quality stays consistent across projects.
                </p>
              </article>
            </li>
            <li>
              <article class="about-team-card morph-clay-card">
                <div class="about-team-card__avatar" aria-hidden="true">ML</div>
                <h3 class="about-team-card__name">Michelle Lawal</h3>
                <p class="about-team-card__role">Role: CFO</p>
                <p class="about-team-card__resp">
                  Responsibilities: Owns financial planning, budgeting, and reporting, and keeps the company financially
                  sound and compliant as we grow.
                </p>
              </article>
            </li>
            <li>
              <article class="about-team-card morph-clay-card">
                <div class="about-team-card__avatar" aria-hidden="true">OI</div>
                <h3 class="about-team-card__name">Onochie Igboerika</h3>
                <p class="about-team-card__role">Role: Creative Director</p>
                <p class="about-team-card__resp">
                  Responsibilities: Sets creative direction and quality bars across campaigns and productions, and
                  guides visual and narrative work so output matches the Siryus standard.
                </p>
              </article>
            </li>
            <li>
              <article class="about-team-card morph-clay-card">
                <div class="about-team-card__avatar" aria-hidden="true">OL</div>
                <h3 class="about-team-card__name">Opeyemi Lawal</h3>
                <p class="about-team-card__role">Role: Media &amp; Marketing Lead</p>
                <p class="about-team-card__resp">
                  Responsibilities: Leads media strategy, campaigns, and channel execution for brands and artists, and
                  connects creative ideas to reach, engagement, and growth.
                </p>
              </article>
            </li>
            <li>
              <article class="about-team-card morph-clay-card">
                <div class="about-team-card__avatar" aria-hidden="true">AE</div>
                <h3 class="about-team-card__name">Ailemen Esther</h3>
                <p class="about-team-card__role">Role: Legal Lead</p>
                <p class="about-team-card__resp">
                  Responsibilities: Handles contracts, compliance, and legal risk, and protects the company and artists in
                  deals, rights, and partnerships.
                </p>
              </article>
            </li>
            <li>
              <article class="about-team-card morph-clay-card">
                <div class="about-team-card__avatar" aria-hidden="true">BR</div>
                <h3 class="about-team-card__name">Beza Peace Rachel</h3>
                <p class="about-team-card__role">Role: Collaborations and Partnerships</p>
                <p class="about-team-card__resp">
                  Responsibilities: Builds and manages partnerships, collaborations, and sponsor relationships that fit the
                  brand and open new opportunities for artists and the business.
                </p>
              </article>
            </li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="about-bleed about-cta about-reveal" aria-labelledby="about-cta-heading">
      <div class="about-inner about-cta__inner">
        <h2 id="about-cta-heading" class="about-cta__heading">Ready to Build Something?</h2>
        <p class="about-cta__copy">
          Whether you are an artist looking for management or a brand that needs a real creative partner, we want to hear
          from you.
        </p>
        <a href="/contact" class="about-cta__btn">Work With Us</a>
      </div>
    </section>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>

<script is:inline>
  (function () {
    document.querySelectorAll('.founder-photo img').forEach(function (img) {
      var wrap = img.closest('.founder-photo');
      function markLoaded() {
        if (wrap) wrap.classList.add('has-loaded');
      }
      function markError() {
        if (wrap) wrap.classList.add('has-error');
      }
      if (img.complete && img.naturalHeight > 0) {
        markLoaded();
      } else {
        img.addEventListener('load', markLoaded);
        img.addEventListener('error', markError);
      }
    });

    var reduce = window.matchMedia('(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)').matches;
    var els = document.querySelectorAll('.about-reveal');
    if (reduce) {
      els.forEach(function (el) {
        el.classList.add('is-visible');
      });
      return;
    }
    var io = new IntersectionObserver(
      function (entries) {
        entries.forEach(function (e) {
          if (e.isIntersecting) {
            e.target.classList.add('is-visible');
            io.unobserve(e.target);
          }
        });
      },
      { threshold: 0.12, rootMargin: '0px 0px -32px 0px' }
    );
    els.forEach(function (el) {
      io.observe(el);
    });
  })();
</script>

<style>
  .about-page {
    margin-left: calc(-1 * var(--about-pad, 1rem));
    margin-right: calc(-1 * var(--about-pad, 1rem));
    width: calc(100% + 2 * var(--about-pad, 1rem));
    max-width: none;
  }

  .about-bleed {
    position: relative;
    left: 50%;
    right: 50%;
    margin-left: -50vw;
    margin-right: -50vw;
    width: 100vw;
    max-width: 100vw;
    box-sizing: border-box;
  }

  .about-inner {
    max-width: 1200px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding-left: var(--space-6);
    padding-right: var(--space-6);
  }

  .about-reveal {
    opacity: 0;
    transform: translateY(28px);
    transition:
      opacity 0.65s ease,
      transform 0.65s ease;
  }

  .about-reveal.is-visible {
    opacity: 1;
    transform: translateY(0);
  }

  /* Hero: editorial manuscript + neu plate + skeuo photo (distinct from home carousel) */
  .about-hero {
    position: relative;
    overflow: hidden;
    background: var(--brand-bg-deep);
    padding: var(--space-20) 0 var(--space-16);
    border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05);
  }

  .about-hero__bg {
    position: absolute;
    inset: 0;
    pointer-events: none;
  }

  .about-hero__bg-img {
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    object-fit: cover;
    object-position: center 35%;
    opacity: 0.22;
    filter: saturate(0.85) contrast(1.05);
  }

  .about-hero__bg-scrim {
    position: absolute;
    inset: 0;
    background: linear-gradient(
      105deg,
      rgba(8, 8, 10, 0.94) 0%,
      rgba(10, 10, 12, 0.82) 48%,
      rgba(8, 8, 10, 0.75) 100%
    );
  }

  .about-hero__grain {
    position: absolute;
    inset: 0;
    opacity: 0.07;
    pointer-events: none;
    background-image: url("data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg viewBox='0 0 256 256' xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%3E%3Cfilter id='n'%3E%3CfeTurbulence type='fractalNoise' baseFrequency='0.9' numOctaves='4' stitchTiles='stitch'/%3E%3C/filter%3E%3Crect width='100%25' height='100%25' filter='url(%23n)'/%3E%3C/svg%3E");
    mix-blend-mode: overlay;
  }

  .about-hero__warm-glow {
    position: absolute;
    pointer-events: none;
    bottom: -28%;
    left: -18%;
    width: min(72vw, 520px);
    height: min(52vh, 420px);
    background: radial-gradient(
      ellipse 80% 70% at 35% 75%,
      rgba(200, 140, 88, 0.18) 0%,
      rgba(120, 80, 48, 0.06) 45%,
      transparent 72%
    );
    opacity: 0.95;
  }

  .about-hero__shell {
    position: relative;
    z-index: 1;
  }

  .about-hero__grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1.12fr) minmax(260px, 0.88fr);
    gap: var(--space-10);
    align-items: center;
  }

  .about-hero__manuscript {
    text-align: left;
  }

  .about-hero__well {
    padding: var(--space-1) var(--space-2);
  }

  .about-hero__visual {
    position: relative;
    justify-self: end;
    width: 100%;
    max-width: 380px;
  }

  .about-hero__frame {
    position: relative;
    z-index: 1;
    border-radius: 18px;
    transform: rotate(-1.5deg);
    transition: transform 0.45s cubic-bezier(0.22, 1, 0.36, 1);
  }

  .about-hero__frame:hover {
    transform: rotate(0deg) translateY(-4px);
  }

  .about-hero__frame img {
    aspect-ratio: 4 / 5;
    max-height: min(420px, 52vh);
  }

  .about-hero__orb {
    position: absolute;
    width: 88px;
    height: 88px;
    right: -12%;
    bottom: 8%;
    z-index: 0;
    opacity: 0.85;
  }

  .about-hero__rule {
    border: none;
    height: 1px;
    margin: var(--space-8) 0 0;
    max-width: 12rem;
    background: linear-gradient(
      90deg,
      var(--brand-accent) 0%,
      rgba(209, 223, 75, 0.35) 55%,
      transparent 100%
    );
  }

  .about-hero__label {
    display: inline-block;
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-size: var(--text-xs);
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 0.12em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--brand-accent);
    border: 1px solid var(--brand-surface-border);
    background: var(--brand-accent-dim);
    padding: var(--space-1) var(--space-4);
    border-radius: var(--radius-full);
    margin-bottom: var(--space-6);
  }

  .about-hero__title {
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-size: clamp(2rem, 5vw, 3.25rem);
    font-weight: 900;
    color: var(--brand-text);
    line-height: 1.08;
    letter-spacing: -0.02em;
    margin: 0 0 var(--space-6);
  }

  .about-hero__sub {
    font-size: var(--text-lg);
    color: var(--brand-text-muted);
    line-height: 1.65;
    margin: 0;
    max-width: 36rem;
  }

  /* Section headings */
  .about-section-heading {
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-size: clamp(1.5rem, 3vw, 2rem);
    font-weight: 800;
    color: var(--brand-text);
    line-height: 1.2;
    letter-spacing: -0.02em;
    margin: 0 0 var(--space-6);
  }

  /* Story */
  .about-story {
    background: var(--brand-bg-base);
    padding: var(--space-16) 0;
    border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05);
  }

  .about-story__grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1.1fr;
    gap: var(--space-12);
    align-items: start;
  }

  .about-story__quote-wrap .about-section-heading {
    margin-bottom: var(--space-5);
  }

  .about-story__pull {
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-size: clamp(1.35rem, 2.5vw, 1.75rem);
    font-weight: 700;
    line-height: 1.35;
    color: var(--brand-text);
    margin: 0;
    padding: var(--space-6) 0 0 var(--space-5);
    border-left: 3px solid var(--brand-accent);
    font-style: normal;
  }

  .about-story__body p {
    font-size: var(--text-base);
    line-height: 1.75;
    color: var(--brand-text-muted);
    margin: 0 0 var(--space-5);
  }

  .about-story__body p:last-child {
    margin-bottom: 0;
  }

  /* Values */
  .about-values {
    background: var(--brand-bg-deep);
    padding: var(--space-16) 0;
    border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05);
  }

  .about-values__title {
    margin-bottom: var(--space-10);
  }

  .about-values__grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
    gap: var(--space-6);
  }

  .about-value-card {
    padding: var(--space-8);
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: var(--space-5);
    border-radius: var(--radius-xl);
    position: relative;
    overflow: hidden;
  }

  .about-value-card__icon {
    color: var(--brand-text-muted);
    transition: color var(--transition-base);
  }

  .about-value-card:hover .about-value-card__icon {
    color: var(--brand-accent);
  }

  .about-value-card__heading {
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-size: var(--text-xl);
    font-weight: 800;
    color: var(--brand-text);
    line-height: 1.2;
    margin: 0;
    letter-spacing: -0.01em;
  }

  .about-value-card__copy {
    font-size: var(--text-sm);
    line-height: 1.75;
    color: var(--brand-text-muted);
    margin: 0;
  }

  :global(body.light-theme) .about-value-card__heading {
    color: var(--brand-text);
  }

  /* Team */
  .about-team {
    background: var(--brand-bg-base);
    padding: var(--space-16) 0;
    border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05);
  }

  .about-team__block {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: var(--space-12);
  }

  .about-team__grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
    gap: var(--space-5);
    list-style: none;
    margin: 0;
    padding: 0;
  }

  .about-team__grid > li {
    margin: 0;
    min-width: 0;
  }

  .about-team-card {
    padding: var(--space-6);
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: var(--space-4);
    align-items: flex-start;
    border-radius: var(--radius-xl);
    height: 100%;
    box-sizing: border-box;
  }

  .about-team-card__avatar {
    width: 3rem;
    height: 3rem;
    border-radius: var(--radius-md);
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-size: var(--text-xs);
    font-weight: 800;
    letter-spacing: 0.02em;
    color: var(--brand-text-muted);
    background: linear-gradient(145deg, var(--brand-surface) 0%, var(--brand-bg-elevated) 100%);
    border: 1px solid var(--brand-surface-border);
    flex-shrink: 0;
  }

  .about-team-card__name {
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-size: var(--text-base);
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--brand-text);
    line-height: 1.3;
    margin: 0;
    letter-spacing: -0.01em;
  }

  .about-team-card__role {
    font-size: var(--text-sm);
    line-height: 1.45;
    color: var(--brand-text);
    font-weight: 600;
    margin: 0;
  }

  .about-team-card__resp {
    font-size: var(--text-sm);
    line-height: 1.65;
    color: var(--brand-text-muted);
    margin: 0;
  }

  .about-founder-card {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: minmax(200px, 280px) 1fr;
    gap: var(--space-8);
    align-items: start;
    max-width: 800px;
  }

  .founder-photo {
    position: relative;
    aspect-ratio: 1;
    border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
    overflow: hidden;
    background: var(--brand-surface);
